Archipela Matching (archipela-matching)
=======================================

This repository contains only the self-developed ranking and capacitated
assignment algorithms used by 研屿 Archipela. It does not bundle model weights.

Optional upstream (not required to run unit tests)
--------------------------------------------------
When embedding scores are supplied by the caller (for example from
BAAI/bge-small-zh-v1.5 via Xenova ONNX exports and @huggingface/transformers),
those components remain under their own licenses (typically MIT for the
referenced BGE small Chinese checkpoint). Callers must retain upstream
LICENSE/NOTICE and attribution when redistributing models.

